Third-party components integrated into this project:

1. SpektraLab for Android — the Vulkan backend port, JNI bridge, native
   build scripts and buildable Android project this app is derived from
   (forked/adapted as app/src/main/java/app/spektralab/engine/ and
   app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/libspektrafilm_engine.so)
   — Copyright (C) steveJJJ
   — Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later
   — Upstream: https://github.com/steveJJJ/SpektraLab-Android
     (originally published as SAINTTaiYi/SpektraLab-Android)
   — Modified: trimmed to the expose-develop pipeline used here; UI,
     camera layer, EXIF writing and package structure changed.

2. SpektraLab physical film / paper simulation engine (the upstream core
   model behind libspektrafilm_engine.so)
   — Copyright (C) JamesQiu2005 / SpektraLab contributors
   — Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later
   — Upstream: https://github.com/JamesQiu2005/SpektraLab

3. spektrafilm — film models, 28 measured stock configurations and the
   enlargement LUTs wrapped by the engine's default resources
   — Copyright (C) Andrea Volpato
   — Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
   — Upstream: https://github.com/andreavolpato/spektrafilm

4. Film / print stock profiles (app/src/main/assets/resources/profiles/,
   stock_catalog.json, print_luts.json, neutral_print_filters.json,
   spektrafilm_constants.bin and other engine resources)
   — Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
   — See LICENSE-SPEKTRAFILM.txt
   — Modified: only the stocks used by this app are kept; Chinese display
     names added.
